    "bounding box" : [ 37.001, 165.86, 178.014, 261.51 ],
    "font" : "HelveticaNeue-LightItalic",
    "font size" : 10.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "Dr. Stoutt is a partner in the Springs Pediatrics and Aviation Medicine Clinic, Louisville, Ky., and he has been an active AME since 1960. No longer an active pilot, he holds a commercial pilot’s certificate with instrument, multi-engine, and CFI ratings."
  }, {
